          %h2#references References
          %p KR theory was introduced in:
          %ul
            %li#Atiyah66
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Atiyah"}> Michael Atiyah
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em K-theory and reality
              %strong 17
              1 (1966) 367-386 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1093/qmath/17.1.367"}> doi:10.1093/qmath/17.1.367
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/AtiyahKReal.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The version of
            = succeed "-theory" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi KSC
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} KSC
          %ul
            %li#Anderson64
              D. W. Anderson,
              %em The real K-theory of classifying spaces
              Proc. Nat. Acad. Sci. U. S. A., 51(4):634–636, 1964.
          %p
            Early discussion in the broader context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real-oriented+cohomology+theory"} real-oriented cohomology theory
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Real+cobordism+cohomology"} Real cobordism cohomology
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sh%C3%B4r%C3%B4+Araki"}> Shôrô Araki
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi τ
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \tau
                  \-Cohomology Theories
              %strong 4
              2 (1978) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.4099/math1924.4.363"}> doi:10.4099/math1924.4.363
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p The dual concept of KR-homology:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gennady+Kasparov"}> Gennady Kasparov
              ,
              %em
                The operator K-functor and extensions of
                = succeed "-algebras," do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi C
                          %mo *
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\ast
              Izv. Akad. Nauk. SSSR Ser. Mat. 44, 571-636 (1980)
          %p
            Discussion for
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+varieties"} algebraic varieties
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Max+Karoubi"}> Max Karoubi
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Weibel"} Charles Weibel
              = succeed "," do
                %em Algebraic and Real K-theory of Algebraic varieties
              %strong 42
              (2003) 715-742 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0509412"}> arXiv:math/0509412
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0040-9383(02)00069-1"} doi:10.1016/S0040-9383(02)00069-1
          %p
            Discussion in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+homotopy+theory"} equivariant homotopy theory
          %ul
            %li
              Paolo Masulli,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Equivariant homotopy:
                  = succeed "-theory" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi KR
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} KR
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.ku.dk/~jg/students/masulli.msthesis.2011.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/MasulliKRTheory2011.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+K-theory"} equivariant K-theory
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KR-theory"} KR-theory
            for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+group"} finite
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariance+groups"} equivariance groups
          %ul
            %li#BrunerGreenlees10
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Bruner"}> Robert Bruner
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Greenlees"} John Greenlees
              = succeed "," do
                %em Connective Real K-Theory of Finite Groups
              %strong 169
              AMS 2010 (
              %a{:href => "https://bookstore.ams.org/surv-169"}> ISBN:978-0-8218-5189-0
              )
          %p
            Computations over
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact+Lie+groups"} compact Lie groups
            in the context of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+ad-equivariant+K-theory"} twisted ad-equivariant K-theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chi-Kwong+Fok"}> Chi-Kwong Fok
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Real K-theory of compact Lie groups
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1308.3871"} arXiv:1308.3871
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.3842/SIGMA.2014.022"} doi:10.3842/SIGMA.2014.022
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chi-Kwong+Fok"}> Chi-Kwong Fok
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Equivariant twisted Real K-theory of compact Lie groups
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.00957"} arXiv:1503.00957
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.geomphys.2017.11.013"} doi:10.1016/j.geomphys.2017.11.013
          %p
            Discussion in the general context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real+oriented+cohomology+theory"} real oriented cohomology theory
            is in
          %ul
            %li#Kriz01
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Po+Hu"}> Po Hu
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Kriz"} Igor Kriz
              = succeed "," do
                %em Real-oriented homotopy theory and an analogue of the Adams-Novikov spectral sequence
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.rochester.edu/people/faculty/doug/otherpapers/hukriz.pdf"} pdf
          %p Further discussion includes
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Johan+Dupont"}> Johan Dupont
              ,
              %em
                Symplectic bundles and
                = succeed "-theory" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi KR
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} KR
              (1967) (
              %a{:href => "http://www.mscand.dk/article.php?id=1908"}> pdf
              )
          %p Reviews include
          %ul
            %li
              Wikipedia,
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KR-theory"} KR-theory
          %p
            Relation to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+Hermitian+K-theory"} topological Hermitian K-theory
            via the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hyperbolic+functor"} hyperbolic functor
          %ul
            %li#Crabb80
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+C.+Crabb"}> Michael C. Crabb
                , §9 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi ℤ
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                          %mn 2
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{Z}/2
                    \-Homotopy Theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 44
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://archive.org/details/zz2homotopytheor0000crab"} ark:/13960/t3jx7bg4w
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.maths.ed.ac.uk/~v1ranick/papers/crabb.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Po+Hu"}> Po Hu
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Kriz"} Igor Kriz
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological Hermitian cobordism
                %strong 11
                (2016) 173–197 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s40062-014-0100-9"}> doi:10.1007/s40062-014-0100-9
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Max+Karoubi"}> Max Karoubi
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Weibel"} Charles Weibel
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Twisted
                    = succeed "-theory," do
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi K
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} K
                    = succeed "-bundles" do
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi A
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
                %strong 221
                7 (2017) 1629-1640 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpaa.2016.12.020"}> doi:10.1016/j.jpaa.2016.12.020
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Remarks on homotopy-theoretic KR in the context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+K-theory"} algebraic K-theory
            are in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vigleik+Angeltveit"}> Vigleik Angeltveit
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Blumberg"} Andrew Blumberg
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Teena+Gerhardt"} Teena Gerhardt
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Hill"} Michael Hill
              %em Algebraic K-theory and equivariant homotopy theory
              (2012) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://www.birs.ca/workshops/2012/12w5116/report12w5116.pdf"}> pdf
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+K-theory"} equivariant
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+K-theory"} twisted
            versions of KR-theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/El-ka%C3%AFoum+M.+Moutuou"}> El-kaïoum M. Moutuou
                ,
                %em Twistings of KR for Real groupoids
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1110.6836"}> arXiv:1110.6836
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/El-ka%C3%AFoum+M.+Moutuou"}> El-kaïoum M. Moutuou
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Graded Brauer groups of a groupoid with involution
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1202.2057"} arXiv:1202.2057
            %li#Freed12
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Freed"}> Daniel Freed
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Lectures on twisted K-theory and orientifolds
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/FreedESI2012.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Freed"}> Daniel Freed
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gregory+Moore"} Gregory Moore
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Twisted equivariant matter
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1208.5055"} arXiv:1208.5055
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007%2Fs00023-013-0236-x"} doi:10.1007%2Fs00023-013-0236-x
            %li#Gomi17
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kiyonori+Gomi"}> Kiyonori Gomi
                ,
                %em Freed-Moore K-theory
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.09134"}> arXiv:1705.09134
                ,
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/1601772"} spire:1601772
            %li
              %p
                Tim Lüders, Lynn Otto,
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Konrad+Waldorf"} Konrad Waldorf
                %em Real twistings are 2-line bundles
                (2025). (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.18102"}> arXiv:2502.18102
                ).
          %p
            This is with motivation from
            = succeed "," do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientifolds"} orientifolds
            = succeed "-classes" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi KR
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} KR
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/T-duality"} T-duality
            on
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientifolds"} orientifolds
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/O-planes"} O-planes
            is in
          %ul
            %li#Gukov00
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergei+Gukov"}> Sergei Gukov
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em K-Theory, Reality, and Orientifolds
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9901042"} arXiv:hep-th/9901042
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane+charge"} D-brane charge
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/T-duality"} T-duality
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientifolds"} orientifolds
            formulated in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KR-theory"} KR-theory
            (cf. also
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KSC-theory"} KSC-theory
          %ul
            %li#DMR13
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Doran"}> Charles Doran
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Mendez-Diez"} Stefan Mendez-Diez
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathan+Rosenberg"} Jonathan Rosenberg
                = succeed "," do
                  %em T-duality For Orientifolds and Twisted KR-theory
                %strong 104
                11 (2014) 1333-1364 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1306.1779"}> arXiv:1306.1779
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s11005-014-0715-0"} doi:10.1007/s11005-014-0715-0
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (but see
